#. …何か用か？
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...What do you want?"
msgstr ""

#. 十神クン…
#. その、朝食会には…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, well...the breakfast meeting..."
msgstr ""

#. 出ると思うか？
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You honestly expect me to go?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Right...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうだ…せっかく会ったんだし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh, as long as I'm here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンはアルターエゴの情報をどう思ってるのか、
#. 聞いておいた方が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I should ask Byakuya what he made of the stuff\n"
"Alter Ego told us.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…いや、駄目だ。
#. ここじゃ監視カメラが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Actually no, I'd better not. The surveillance camera\n"
"would catch us, for sure.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …なんだ？
msgctxt "0008 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...So?"
msgstr ""

#. え、えっと、その…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, um...well..."
msgstr ""

#. フン…
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hmph..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あぁ、行っちゃった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He's gone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おわっ、苗木っち！
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Whoa! Makoto!"
msgstr ""

#. な、なに？
#. なんでそんなにびっくりしてるの？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Huh? Why do you sound so surprised?"
msgstr ""

#. 勘弁してくれ…
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "S-Sorry about that. It's just..."
msgstr ""

#. あと１分くらい早く来てたら、
#. 朝から俺の寿命が縮むとこだったべ。
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"If you'd gotten here even a minute earlier, it\n"
"would've cost me a few more minutes off my life!"
msgstr ""

#. え？　どうして？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What? Why?"
msgstr ""

#. それは、霧切っちが
#. さっきまでここにいたからだべ。
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Cuz Kyoko, like, JUST left!"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんが？
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko?"
msgstr ""

#. あのなぁ、苗木っち。
msgctxt "0019 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Ya know, Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. 男女の修羅場っちゅーもんはな…
#. 他人の命も縮めるんだべ。
msgctxt "0020 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"When a guy and girl go at it, it shortens the lives of\n"
"the people who have to watch it happen, too."
msgstr ""

#. この俺が言うんだから間違いないベ！
msgctxt "0021 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "And since it's me saying it, you know it's true!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、早く仲直りするべ。
msgctxt "0022 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So like, hurry up and make it better."
msgstr ""

#. んじゃ、俺は先に行くな。
msgctxt "0023 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Anyway, see ya at breakfast!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、言われてもな…
#. ボクにはどうしようもないよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's easy for him to say. But what am I supposed to\n"
"do?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おはよう、朝日奈さん。
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Good morning, Hina."
msgstr ""

#. おっはよー！
msgctxt "0026 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Mornin'!"
msgstr ""

#. ねえねえ、昨日の苗木…
#. ちょっと格好良かったよ！
msgctxt "0027 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey, so...yesterday...you were kinda cool!"
msgstr ""

#. え？　なんの事？
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. ほら、アルターエゴを仲間だって言った事！
msgctxt "0029 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You know, when you said Alter Ego was your friend!"
msgstr ""

#. 私もさ、同じような事、
#. 思ってたんだけど…
msgctxt "0030 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I was thinking the same thing."
msgstr ""

#. 私、ああいう時に
#. うまい言葉が思いつかないんだよ…
msgctxt "0031 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But when stuff like that happens, I never know how to\n"
"say what I'm thinking..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、苗木が言ってくれて
#. スゴく嬉しかった！
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So I'm really glad you said it for me!"
msgstr ""

#. エヘヘ…ありがと！
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So...thanks! Ehehe..."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どういたしまして…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-You're welcome..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木ってさ、いつもは普通だけど…
#. いざって時は、どーんって力出すよね！
msgctxt "0035 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You're usually like, totally normal. But when the time\n"
"comes, BAM! You bust out your special power."
msgstr ""

#. ほら、その…今までのだって…
#. 苗木がなんとかしてくれたようなもんだし…
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I mean, even before yesterday, when stuff comes up,\n"
"it's like...you always do something about it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今までのって…
#. きっと、学級裁判の事だよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even before yesterday...? Are you talking about the\n"
"class trials and stuff?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事…ないよ…
#. たまたまだよ…
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I mean, that stuff is just...it just kinda took care\n"
"of itself, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事あるよ！
msgctxt "0039 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It totally didn't!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木やさくらちゃんたちと力を合わせれば…
#. きっと、ここから脱出だってできるよね…
msgctxt "0040 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"With your power, and Sakura's, and everyone else...I'm\n"
"sure we'll get outta here..."
msgstr ""

#. うん、できるさ。
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, I think you're right."
msgstr ""

#. だよね！　よーしっ！！
msgctxt "0042 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I am, right!? Alright!"
msgstr ""

#. 気合も入ったところで、
#. 朝ご飯に行こうーっと！
msgctxt "0043 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Now that we've got that fighting spirit, let's go get\n"
"some grub!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そうだよな…道のりは長くても…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She's right... Even if the road is long...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>進まなくちゃ、ゴールにはたどり着けないんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If we don't keep on moving forward, we'll never reach\n"
"our goal!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋に帰る用事はないな…
#. みんな待ってるし、食堂に行こう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't need to go back to my room. Everyone should be\n"
"in the dining hall...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
